{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JDG","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"士師記","commonName":"士師記","title":"士師記","order":7,"numberOfChapters":21,"sha256":"212088674548da5a72a7014867e18c2e0357e626ca5eeab0a215cd4cc9fde0b7","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JDG/1.json","lastChapterNumber":21,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JDG/21.json","totalNumberOfVerses":616},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["底波拉和巴拉之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那一天，底波拉和亞比挪庵的兒子巴拉高唱凱歌："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"「以色列的首領身先士卒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"民眾前仆後繼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要讚美耶和華！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王啊，請聽！首領啊，請側耳聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要向耶和華歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要歌頌以色列的上帝耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，當你從西珥出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"走過以東時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地震動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天上下雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雲降雨水。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在西奈山的耶和華面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在以色列的上帝耶和華面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"群山震動。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在亞拿的兒子珊迦與雅億的時代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大路行人絕跡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"旅客繞道前行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我底波拉做以色列之母以前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的鄉村杳無人煙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人選擇新的神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便戰禍臨門，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四萬以色列人中找不到一矛一盾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心追隨以色列的首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追隨民中踴躍出征的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要讚美耶和華！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"「你們騎白驢的、坐繡花毯子的、步行的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都要傾聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歌樂手聚集在井旁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傳揚耶和華和祂以色列子民的勝利。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的子民都來到城門口。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「底波拉啊，來吧，來吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歌唱吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞比挪庵的兒子巴拉啊，來吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶走你的戰俘吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倖存的以色列人響應他們的首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的子民為我攻擊勇士。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們有些來自原屬亞瑪力人的以法蓮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有些來自便雅憫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"統領出自瑪吉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將官出自西布倫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以薩迦的首領與底波拉同往，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以薩迦人隨巴拉同去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾人一起衝進山谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"呂便人卻猶豫不決。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"呂便人為什麼坐在羊圈中聽悠悠笛聲？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們舉棋不定。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基列人留在約旦河東岸。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但人為什麼停留在船上？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞設人在海岸靜坐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在港口逗留。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但西布倫人捨生忘死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿弗他利人拼死鏖戰沙場。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"「迦南諸王來戰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"來到米吉多河邊的他納交戰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻沒有掠走金銀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"星辰從天上爭戰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從它們的軌道攻擊西西拉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古老的基順河沖走了敵人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心啊，要奮勇向前！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蹄聲隆隆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"駿馬疾馳！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華的天使說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『要咒詛米羅斯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要重重地咒詛米羅斯的居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們沒有幫助耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有幫助耶和華攻擊強敵。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"「基尼人希百的妻子雅億是婦人中最有福的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是住帳篷的婦人中最有福的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西西拉求水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅億給他奶喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用珍貴的碗盛上乳酪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅億左手拿起橛子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"右手拿起工匠的錘子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猛擊西西拉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎了他的頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刺透了他的太陽穴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西西拉屈身倒下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"死在她腳前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一動不動地躺在那裡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"「西西拉的母親憑窗遠眺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"隔著窗櫺喊道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『為什麼他的戰車遲遲不回？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼還聽不到車輪聲？』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聰明的宮女安慰她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她卻依然自言自語，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『莫非他們在搜索、瓜分戰利品？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每人得到一兩個少女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西西拉分得繡花彩巾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"繡花的彩色圍巾作戰利品。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你的敵人都像西西拉一樣滅亡！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願愛你的人都如升起的太陽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"光輝熠熠！」","poem":1},"此後，以色列安享太平四十年。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JDG/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JDG/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JDG/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}